    <li><strong>Alternative-fuel availability is highly limited.</strong> HVO and B10 are offered at fewer than 60 stations each. If the government wishes to accelerate uptake of lower-carbon fuels, supply-side incentives or infrastructure grants may be needed to expand forecourt coverage beyond early-adopter locations.</li>

    <li><strong>Negative timestamp lags indicate system-level synchronisation issues.</strong> 1,011 records show source_updated_at later than recorded_at. While small in proportion (~2%), this undermines confidence in audit trails. A standardised UTC clock-sync protocol across the reporting pipeline would improve data integrity.</li>
  </ol>

